<title>INDIA: CRICKET-INDIA V AUSTRALIA TEST SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA V AUSTRALIA TEST SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the opening day</p>
<p>of the one-off test match between India and Australia on</p>
<p>Thursday:</p>
<p>Australia first innings</p>
<p> M.Slater c and b Kumble	  44</p>
<p> M.Taylor lbw b Prasad	    27</p>
<p> R.Ponting b Kapoor		 14</p>
<p> M.Waugh c Dravid b Joshi	 26</p>
<p> S.Waugh c Mongia b Kapoor	 0</p>
<p> M.Bevan lbw b Joshi		26</p>
<p> I.Healy b Kumble		   17</p>
<p> B.Hogg c Rathore b Kumble	 1</p>
<p> P.Reiffel c Dravid b Kumble     7</p>
<p> P.McIntyre not out		  6</p>
<p> G.McGrath run out		   6</p>
<p> Extras (b-4 lb-3 nb-1)	    8</p>
<p> Total				 182</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-47 2-81 3-93 4-94 5-143 6-144 7-147 8-169</p>
<p>9-170</p>
<p>Bowling: Prasad 12-4-34-1, Johnson 4-1-12-0, Joshi</p>
<p>23-7-36-2, Kumble 24-7-63-4 (nb-1), Kapoor 10-3-30-2</p>
<p>India first innings</p>
<p> V.Rathore c Ponting b Reiffel	5</p>
<p> N.Mongia not out			26</p>
<p> S.Ganguly not out		     19</p>
<p> Extras (b-4 nb-3)			7</p>
<p> Total (for one wicket)		57</p>
<p>Fall of wicket: 1-13</p>
<p>To bat: S.Tendulkar, M.Azharuddin, R.Dravid, S.Joshi,</p>
<p>A.Kapoor, A.Kumble, V.Prasad, D.Johnson.</p>
<p>Bowling (to date): McGrath 4-0-8-0 (nb-2), Reiffel 6-2-13-1,</p>
<p>S.Waugh 4-1-13-0 (nb-1), McIntyre 4-1-10-0, Hogg 3-1-9-0.</p>
